This page describes reproductions from the raw document collection for passage ranking _on the augmented version_ of the MS MARCO V2 passage corpus using the dev queries.
Here, we expand the augmented passage corpus with doc2query-T5.
For additional instructions on working with the MS MARCO V2 passage corpus, refer to [this page](${root_path}/docs/experiments-msmarco-v2.md).

This page is automatically generated from [this template](${template}) by the `GenerateReproductionDocsFromDocumentCollectionTest` JUnit test case, so do not modify this page directly; modify the template instead.

From one of our Waterloo servers (e.g., `orca`), the following command will perform the complete regression, end to end:

```bash
bin/run.sh io.anserini.reproduce.ReproduceFromDocumentCollection --index --verify --search --config ${test_name}
```

